<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DevOps Lab 4 — Jinja2 Dynamic Template</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: #0b0f19;
      color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .card {
      background: #161e2e;
      border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px;
      max-width: 650px;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #38bdf8;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 26px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid #38bdf8;
      color: #38bdf8;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .table-info {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      background: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .table-info td {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .table-info tr:last-child td {
      border-bottom: none;
    }
    .lbl {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-weight: 600;
      width: 40%;
    }
    .val {
      color: #10b981;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .status-ok {
      background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
      color: #34d399;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      border: 1px solid #10b981;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="badge">🔥 BÀI TẬP MỞ RỘNG: JINJA2 TEMPLATE + HANDLERS</div>
    <h1>🚀 DevOps Lab 4 — Ansible Managed</h1>
    <div class="subtitle">Trang web được render động bằng Jinja2 Engine & tự động Restart qua Handler</div>

    <table class="table-info">
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">Server Hostname:</td>
        <td class="val">{{ ansible_hostname }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">Hệ điều hành:</td>
        <td class="val">{{ ansible_distribution }} {{ ansible_distribution_version }} ({{ ansible_architecture }})</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">Target IP / Port:</td>
        <td class="val">{{ ansible_host }}:{{ ansible_port }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">RAM hệ thống:</td>
        <td class="val">{{ ansible_memtotal_mb | default(2048) }} MB</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">Thời gian deploy:</td>
        <td class="val">{{ ansible_date_time.date }} {{ ansible_date_time.time }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">Sinh viên thực hiện:</td>
        <td class="val">NGUYỄN VĂN NAM (DTC235180129)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="lbl">Trường / Lớp:</td>
        <td class="val">ICTU — Lớp K22</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="status-ok">
      ✓ Apache2 Active & Reloaded via Ansible Handler
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
